    "text": "The Casa di Goethe is a museum in Rome that preserves the house where Johann Wolfgang von Goethe lived during his Italian Journey from 1786 to 1788. It showcases his writings, manuscripts, and the artistic milieu of his time in Rome, making it a key cultural site for understanding Goethe’s influence on European literature and art.",
